{"id": "34915", "title": "VIP老公", "author": "水银", "category": "文学名著", "count": 41, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34915/34915s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34915.htm", "intro": "开玩笑！他堂堂源氏财团社长的婚姻岂容他人左右！以他的能力根本就不需要啥政治联姻，更何况他才不要让一些小人得逞咧！想当他的老婆首要条件就是要合乎他「尺寸」！瞧瞧那急欲巴上他的议员身边的小助理，「进退」得宜似乎是个不错的人选……什么？到头来那个势力眼也是她老爸！？好吧！看在他已经「吃」惯她味道的份上，他就勉强接受一下好了！什么？她还有个十分坚固的「后盾」！？呵呵──他的「穿透力」可是天下无敌的啦……哇哩咧！她居然嫌他的「努力」不够！？没关系，他绝对会向她证明他有多「努力」！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34915", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2311208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2311209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2311210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2311211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2311212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2311213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2311214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2311215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2311216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2311217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2311218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2311219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2311220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2311221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2311222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2311223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2311224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2311225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2311226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2311227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2311228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2311229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2311230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2311231.html", "a